--- 2026/05/14 02:30
Remove the extra -lrpc in makefile.
It was introduced by dms38key, but that library has been rebuilt with libtirpc instead.
So -lrpc is no longer needed - only -ltirpc is required.
The NCHC Nano5 machine does not have libtirpc installed, which the original makefile assumed, so a copy of libtirpc was added to the geps_libs. (package not tracked in git)
Also, rewrite the caldtg.ksh (Nano5 does NOT have ksh!) with sh and date command, instead of math formula for leap years, etc. for better readability / robustness.
Copy the original job/build_job.sh (uses PJM) to job/build_job.sh.cwa
Edit the gpu section to use NCHC Nano5 (uses Slurm) instead.
Also, add LD_LIBRARY_PATH for NetCDF in modulefiles/modulefile.tcogfs.gpu so the executable can find it in runtime.

